<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-WORLD CUP OF GOLF SCORES LATEST.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD CUP OF GOLF SCORES LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>SOMERSET WEST, South Africa 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Running first round scores in the World Cup of Golf men's team tournament on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>139 Scotland (Andrew Coltart 70, Paul Lawrie 69)</p>
<p>143 Italy (Manuel Zerman 72, Costantino Rocca 71)</p>
<p>145 Germany  (Bernhard Langer 71, Alexander Cejka 74)</p>
<p>145 Switzerland (Andre Bossert 70 Paolo Quirici 75)</p>
<p>146 Namibia (Trevor Dodds 70, Schalk van der Merwe 76)</p>
<p>148 Mexico (Rafael Alarcon 75 Cesar Perez 73)</p>
<p>150 Puerto Rico (Miguel Suarez 74, Wilfredo Morales 76)</p>
<p>154 Jamaica (Delroy Cambridge 72, Seymour Rose 82)</p>
<p>136 South Africa (Ernie Els 68, Wayne Westner 68)</p>
<p>138 Denmark (Thomas Bjorn 67, Rene Budde 71)</p>
<p>142 China (Jun Cheng 69, Lianwei Zhang 73)</p>
<p>144 France (Jean van de Velde 73, Marc-Antonie Farry 71)</p>
<p>147 United States (Tom Lehman 74, Steve Jones 73)</p>
<p>152 Japan (Tommy Nakajima 78, Katsunori Kuwabara 74)</p>
<p>156 Venezuela (Henrique Lavie 77, Federico Sauce 79)</p>
<p>159 Sri Lanka (Tissa Chandradasa 83, Nandasena Perera</p>
<p>76).</p>
